; operator's truth table, and return the result with lane i in bit i.  Only
; operators that are defined on all four rows appear; lanes that are poison
; are tested in vector-poison.ll.
;
; A bitcast between <N x i1> and iN puts element 0 in the least significant
; bit (little endian).
